\label{sec:abs:det and gaps}
\paragraph{WFAs}
A WFA $\cA=\tup{Q,\Sigma,Q_0,\Delta}$ is a finite automaton where $Q$ is a set of states, $\Sigma$ is an alphabet, $Q_0\subseteq Q$ are initial states,
% \satodo{in the examples we have several initial states, so we should change here to a set of initial states, and also in the body of the paper if needed.}
