    We go up another level: ${\color{Green} w_3=baa{\color{Cerulean}\alpha_4}abba{\color{red}\alpha_2}ba}$ with ${\color{Green}\alpha_3=\alpha_{S_3, w_3}}$. We can consider another word outside, e.g., $ab{\color{Green}\alpha_3} aa$.
