    Let $\sigma\in \Gamma'$ be the next letter read after a prefix $v$ of $xy$, let $i<j$ and let $r,q\in S$ with $r\sim_{\vec{c_{uv}}}\rho_i(uv)$ and $q\sim_{\vec{c_{uv\sigma}}}\rho_j(uv\sigma)$, then there is no transition $(r,\sigma,c,q)\in \augTrans_\infty^\infty$ with $c<\infty$.
