\]
This, however, is a contradiction, since by the second inequality of \cref{eq:sparse gap lower bound} we have (in particular)
$|\vec{c_{uv}}(\rho_j(uv))-\vec{c_{uv}}(\rho_i(uv))|>8 W_{\max}+ 16 G$.
