\subsection{Image Filtering Criteria}
To ensure the quality, relevance, and usability of the visual data used in TCC-Bench, we apply a set of filtering criteria during the image collection process.
\begin{itemize}
\item The image size should be between 100 KB and 3 MB.
\item The image should clearly represent traditional Chinese cultural elements.
\item The cultural content depicted in the image can be categorized into the following knowledge domains: Astronomy, Music, Custom, Architecture, Transportation, Diet, Clothing, and Artifacts.  
\item The image should be licensed under either public domain terms or a non-commercial academic use license.
\end{itemize}

