			 \left( \sum_{m \in \mathcal{M}} \frac{\eta |c_{\rm t}|}{\left(x_{\rm t} - x_{{\rm T}, m} \right)^2 + d_{{\rm t}, m}^2} \right)^2  \nonumber \\
