    \item \textbf{MiniCPM-Llama3-V 2.5} \cite{yao2024minicpm}: A smaller multilingual Vision+Language architecture, also adapted for HTR line recognition. (8B parameters). Trained during 4 epochs (Cosine, 5e-5)
