One can also show this by using (\ref{eq:general_grad_exp}) for the gradient and then using the law of total expectation.
We next prove $\ell$ is convex by showing that $\bm{\nabla}^2\ell$ is positive semidefinite for any value of $\mb{\mu}$.  %everywhere.
