In this section, we provide a detailed tutorial-style description of the architectural components of BemaGANv2. The model adopts a GAN-based vocoder framework, integrating periodicity-aware generator and perceptually motivated discriminator. We begin by describing the generator based on AMP blocks, followed by the Multi-Envelope Discriminator (MED) and Multi-Resolution Discriminator (MRD), and conclude with the training objectives.

\subsection{Generator with AMP Block}

